text:
&lt;inputs&gt;
Ask me for: 8 to 12 UI states I want the shape to become (e.g. button, loader, player, slider, toggle, tabs, chart, command palette, toast), pure black and white or one accent color, and a royalty-free song around 120 BPM (e.g. Mixkit, free for commercial use).
&lt;/inputs&gt;

① Interaction: Third-person perspective, supporting drag, rotation, and zoom, removing extraneous UI, with a square pedestal base;
② Scene objects: Japanese street-corner convenience store, fully equipped with automatic sliding doors, canopy awning, vending machines, bicycles, and umbrella racks;
③ Interior details: Warm interior lighting, bento shelves, beverage refrigerated display cabinets, checkout counter, and oden cooking station, fully visible through the glass windows;
④ Environmental atmosphere: Dim outdoor rainy night, high contrast between cold and warm tones, recreating Japanese anime atmosphere;
⑤ Rendering setup: Detailed modeling + cel-shaded cartoon rendering, clear outlines, wet ground reflections, anime slice-of-life art style;
⑥ Dynamic effects: Continuous rainfall, eaves dripping, puddle ripples, flickering neon signboards, intermittently opening and closing automatic doors, layering delicate dynamic motion on top of a static scene.
